====Rune choice====
Crafting mist and mud runes, with water in the inventory and smoke/fire in the pouch, produces the most profit. Crafting smoke and dust runes with air in the inventory and steam in the pouch is slightly less profitable, but allows crafting at the water altar. If you have a Tome of fire, you can use water runes instead of steam. Conversely, if you have a Tome of water, you can use fire runes instead of steam.

[[File:Ironman chat badge.png|link=Ironman Mode]] Players who craft their own combination runes can alternate as needed (only about 30-60 smoke or steam runes are needed to start).

