===Additional notes===
*The initial altar timing varies, but portal timing is consistent every 140 seconds, save for the first portal of the game that spawns after 160 seconds.
*The unbolded lines are based on a 50s crafting window and 70s initial mining window
**This is achievable with huge/colossal pouches and rune/dragon pickaxes.
*If you find yourself running out of essence, mine for longer and craft less before the 135 altar.
*In the event of an inter-round portal, first fill with essence, then mine fragments until the first altar rotation. After crafting runes at the first altar, the first portal of the round should be immediately accessible.

